 mba dance cardio with strength training\, using intervals to combine Latin
  rhythms with weightlifting or bodyweight exercises\, aiming for total bod
 y toning\, muscle building\, and cardiovascular fitness\, all driven by mo
 tivating music for a fun\, powerful workout. This format integrates resist
 ance training into group fitness\, helping build lean muscle and boost fat
  burning\, with an empowering feel. 
